WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
See the codec. Understand your audio. Bluetooth Audio Codec Viewer.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Connect your headphones, then start a local detection. A temporary helper requests administrator approval. The ready state is shown.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Inspect standard and vendor codec IDs from Windows events. A matching codec event is required.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Preview local diagnostics and export a report. You choose whether to share.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Local detection, no audio recording. Bluetooth Classic A2DP only. HFP and LE Audio are outside scope.
